WEBVTT

01:41.460 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.560 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 29]

01:49.350 --> 01:50.120
It's all in the past.

01:51.280 --> 01:52.310
Since he has changed,

01:53.350 --> 01:54.400
I should let go

01:55.060 --> 01:56.530
and live my own life.

01:59.039 --> 01:59.789
Feihua,

02:00.710 --> 02:01.510
keep these talismans

02:01.510 --> 02:02.760
for emergencies.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.070
If you encounter anything you can't handle,

02:05.430 --> 02:06.560
come to Mount Wester anytime to find me.

02:08.710 --> 02:09.240
Take care.

02:10.130 --> 02:10.740
Take care.

02:15.840 --> 02:17.430
You were right.

02:17.960 --> 02:19.280
Guardian and Ranran actually...

02:19.680 --> 02:20.710
You're so slow.

02:20.960 --> 02:21.960
It took you so long

02:21.980 --> 02:22.710
to finally notice

02:22.710 --> 02:24.310
Guardian's affection and love for her.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.590
Seeing them like this now,

02:26.840 --> 02:28.030
I'm not surprised at all.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.430
Then

02:33.870 --> 02:35.430
you knew Guardian was under the Silencing Curse

02:36.120 --> 02:36.870
as well?

02:39.079 --> 02:39.910
I only thought

02:40.079 --> 02:41.840
he loved Mu Qingge despite knowing

02:41.960 --> 02:43.030
she was the Demon's child.

02:43.750 --> 02:44.710
I never imagined

02:45.050 --> 02:46.770
the truth was this.

02:47.120 --> 02:49.000
So she had been protecting Guardian all along.

02:50.000 --> 02:51.590
We misunderstood her for so many years.

02:54.000 --> 02:54.800
So Master

02:54.820 --> 02:56.180
was under the Silencing Curse.

02:56.430 --> 02:58.000
That's why he couldn't say anything.

02:58.910 --> 03:00.080
No wonder I kept feeling

03:00.080 --> 03:01.150
Ranran looked familiar.

03:01.720 --> 03:03.440
It turns out she looks like Grandmaster

03:03.470 --> 03:04.520
in a portrait I once saw.

03:06.520 --> 03:07.470
She has a similar aura,

03:08.240 --> 03:09.400
but her face has changed.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.590
Those Heavenly sovereigns

03:10.750 --> 03:11.710
didn't recognize her either.

03:12.120 --> 03:12.800
After all,

03:13.120 --> 03:14.030
she's been reborn.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.520
What?

03:20.079 --> 03:21.630
Are you guys going to be all formal with me?

03:23.120 --> 03:23.870
No.

03:24.220 --> 03:25.950
We just pieced

03:25.980 --> 03:26.940
everything together.

03:27.140 --> 03:28.700
Our heads are still buzzing.

03:30.190 --> 03:31.430
We haven't figured out

03:31.750 --> 03:33.190
whether we should call you Ranran

03:33.710 --> 03:34.800
or Grandmaster.

03:35.400 --> 03:36.520
Come on, I'm so young.

03:36.700 --> 03:37.840
Of course I'm Xue Ranran,

03:37.870 --> 03:38.840
your junior sister.

03:39.500 --> 03:40.150
Senior Bai.

03:41.360 --> 03:42.000
Don't think this means

03:42.030 --> 03:42.930
you don't need to pay me back

03:42.950 --> 03:43.950
those three taels of silver.

03:46.150 --> 03:46.680
Xi'er,

03:47.130 --> 03:48.329
from now on, you're not allowed

03:48.360 --> 03:49.470
to only share secrets with Senior Gao

03:49.490 --> 03:50.150
and ignore me.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.590
I'll get jealous.

03:58.480 --> 03:59.490
Master just said

03:59.520 --> 04:00.280
that after sacrificing

04:00.390 --> 04:01.520
your Formless Spirit Root to save him,

04:01.840 --> 04:03.000
you're weak and often feel cold.

04:03.470 --> 04:04.210
He asked us to protect you

04:04.240 --> 04:05.120
with our spiritual power.

04:05.780 --> 04:06.280
How are you feeling?

04:06.710 --> 04:07.520
Feeling warmer?

04:08.080 --> 04:08.750
Thank you.

04:09.030 --> 04:10.590
It's not as serious as Master said.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.190
Also, I have to ask you,

04:13.720 --> 04:14.840
do you all really understand

04:15.120 --> 04:16.630
how dangerous the current situation is?

04:18.040 --> 04:19.040
Master is the Demon's child,

04:19.560 --> 04:21.190
and the Spirit Spring is within him.

04:21.720 --> 04:22.360
Following him

04:22.390 --> 04:23.920
will inevitably make you the target of everyone.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.920
And where we're going is the netherworld,

04:26.310 --> 04:27.400
a place swarming with devils.

04:27.510 --> 04:28.360
There's no telling what awaits us.

04:29.000 --> 04:29.630
Master sent me

04:29.630 --> 04:30.480
to ask where you guys stand.

04:31.160 --> 04:32.110
The safest option

04:32.110 --> 04:32.920
for you all

04:33.500 --> 04:34.600
is to publicly cut ties

04:34.630 --> 04:35.480
with Wester Sect.

04:36.159 --> 04:36.950
No way!

04:38.390 --> 04:39.430
I didn't break any sect rules.

04:39.570 --> 04:40.690
Master can't kick me out.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.720
And I would never betray my sect.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.310
That would be a disgrace to any cultivator.

04:44.830 --> 04:45.950
I've just returned recently.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.800
I won't leave again.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.070
Besides,

04:49.600 --> 04:50.360
we're fellow disciples.

04:50.970 --> 04:52.570
How could we only share joy

04:52.600 --> 04:53.630
but not hardship?

04:54.000 --> 04:54.830
Your Spirit Root is destroyed,

04:55.070 --> 04:55.950
yet you still want to go?

04:56.480 --> 04:56.920
I

04:57.630 --> 04:58.720
won't be outdone by you.

05:00.190 --> 05:00.630
That's right.

05:01.190 --> 05:02.950
What you and Master are going to do is righteous.

05:03.480 --> 05:04.190
As cultivators,

05:04.390 --> 05:05.390
how can we just stand by and do nothing?

05:05.920 --> 05:07.270
Even if we're misunderstood for now,

05:07.740 --> 05:08.570
the truth will come to light

05:08.600 --> 05:09.190
one day.

05:09.870 --> 05:11.040
This is a good opportunity.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.430
I want to be like you,

05:12.820 --> 05:13.950
to accomplish something incredible

05:14.240 --> 05:15.390
that will leave people stunned.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.120
Right.

05:19.030 --> 05:20.070
Let's seal the Spirit Spring

05:20.070 --> 05:20.900
back into the netherworld together

05:21.120 --> 05:22.160
to maintain peace in the universe!

05:23.750 --> 05:24.190
Alright.

05:24.630 --> 05:25.360
Let's accomplish

05:25.390 --> 05:26.390
this remarkable feat together.

05:30.760 --> 05:31.360
Alright!

05:38.680 --> 05:40.560
The way to enter the netherworld...

05:42.800 --> 05:43.800
Blood Moon.

05:45.040 --> 05:46.480
The Blood Moon, born in the netherworld,

05:46.630 --> 05:48.159
shines only on the mortal land where there is

05:48.190 --> 05:49.190
the most bloodshed.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.800
It absorbs malicious energy

05:50.950 --> 05:51.870
to nourish the netherworld.

05:52.190 --> 05:53.720
And it only lasts for 15 minutes.

05:54.159 --> 05:55.220
At midnight, when the Blood Moon appears,

05:55.440 --> 05:56.360
the Demon's child can use his blood

05:56.950 --> 05:58.390
to access the netherworld.

05:59.370 --> 06:00.900
This book only says

06:01.270 --> 06:02.650
the Blood Moon appears in the mortal world

06:02.680 --> 06:04.070
where there's the most bloodshed,

06:04.390 --> 06:06.040
but it doesn't specify where exactly.

06:06.470 --> 06:08.230
The place with the most bloodshed...

06:09.720 --> 06:10.750
Could it be a battlefield?

06:12.070 --> 06:13.270
There have been constant clashes between Great Qi

06:13.270 --> 06:14.040
and its neighboring country at the border.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.390
Things have escalated in recent months.

06:15.480 --> 06:16.250
Battles have become more frequent.

06:16.870 --> 06:18.240
The most brutal one was the recent

06:18.510 --> 06:19.270
Battle of Fanyao.

06:20.000 --> 06:21.480
If the Blood Moon is to appear in the mortal world,

06:22.390 --> 06:23.750
the Fanyao battlefield is the most likely location.

06:28.430 --> 06:29.310
The cracks on the Heavenly Bottle

06:29.360 --> 06:30.270
are spreading.

06:31.000 --> 06:32.470
We must return the Spirit Spring to the netherworld as soon as possible.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.680
We'll depart immediately.

06:35.190 --> 06:36.150
I'll go notify Yu Tong and the others.

06:52.000 --> 06:53.000
I was too impatient.

06:53.390 --> 06:54.830
I forgot you just lost your spiritual power

06:55.070 --> 06:56.040
and can't be overworked or catch a cold.

06:56.830 --> 06:57.720
We'll rest for a night

06:57.950 --> 06:58.750
and set out tomorrow.

07:00.310 --> 07:01.040
I'm fine.

07:01.600 --> 07:02.160
But actually,

07:02.470 --> 07:04.030
I do want to leave a little later.

07:04.390 --> 07:05.360
I still have some preparations

07:05.360 --> 07:06.000
to make.

07:06.830 --> 07:07.480
What preparations?

07:07.830 --> 07:09.500
Now that I can't draw talismans with spiritual power,

07:09.680 --> 07:10.720
I have to draw them by hand.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.650
The netherworld is full of yin energy,

07:13.000 --> 07:13.890
crawling with evil spirits.

07:13.920 --> 07:14.750
It's very dangerous.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.510
We need as many talismans as possible for protection,

07:16.830 --> 07:18.120
but I haven't finished drawing them yet.

07:18.450 --> 07:19.630
The spiritual power of the talisman drawer

07:19.710 --> 07:20.360
will enhance

07:20.390 --> 07:21.600
the power of the talismans.

07:22.040 --> 07:23.240
Now that you've just lost your spiritual power,

07:23.920 --> 07:25.270
the talismans will also be weakened.

07:25.830 --> 07:26.390
I know.

07:26.920 --> 07:28.160
That just means I'll make more.

07:28.520 --> 07:29.960
If one isn't enough, I'll use two.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.040
Hard work makes up for shortcomings.

07:31.510 --> 07:32.390
No need to go to that trouble.

07:32.950 --> 07:33.870
Just use a different type of talisman paper.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.630
Draw on golden talisman paper.

07:38.830 --> 07:39.480
Talismans on it

07:39.480 --> 07:40.640
are ten times stronger than those on normal paper.

07:41.070 --> 07:42.830
Golden talisman paper is very expensive.

07:43.270 --> 07:44.120
You actually have so much of it?

07:46.070 --> 07:47.560
I'm of royal blood, after all.

07:47.950 --> 07:48.950
Wester Sect's wealth

07:49.190 --> 07:49.750
isn't any less than

07:49.750 --> 07:50.830
that of any major Heavenly Sect.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.430
Swift movement talisman.

07:53.620 --> 07:54.470
Blinding talisman.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.240
Spirit shield talisman.

07:56.680 --> 07:57.600
You've drawn them all?

07:57.950 --> 07:58.720
With your spiritual power

07:58.820 --> 08:00.250
and this special talisman paper,

08:00.560 --> 08:01.430
these are practically

08:01.430 --> 08:02.430
top-grade talismans.

08:05.720 --> 08:06.870
The netherworld is drained of energy.

08:07.570 --> 08:08.570
Your "One wisp of qi to break the galaxy" technique

08:08.600 --> 08:09.720
may not have anything to draw power from.

08:10.390 --> 08:11.750
Normal talismans might not be enough.

08:16.500 --> 08:17.020
By the way,

08:17.630 --> 08:18.800
since you can borrow power from heaven and earth,

08:19.360 --> 08:20.480
can you borrow power from me?

08:21.000 --> 08:22.680
Humans are born from heaven and earth,

08:23.040 --> 08:24.680
so they can naturally resonate with them to draw power.

08:25.190 --> 08:26.750
But the spiritual powers between individuals

08:26.830 --> 08:27.600
don't connect.

08:28.070 --> 08:29.240
To draw power from someone else,

08:29.610 --> 08:30.690
one needs to use the Soul-Devouring Lock

08:30.720 --> 08:31.450
or a similar artifact

08:31.600 --> 08:32.630
to channel their powers first.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.440
That's true for most people.

08:35.030 --> 08:35.870
But don't forget,

08:36.280 --> 08:37.240
I saved you using half

08:37.270 --> 08:37.750
of my Golden Core.

08:38.450 --> 08:39.330
You naturally resonate

08:39.360 --> 08:40.270
with the power of my Golden Core.

08:40.789 --> 08:42.440
Even without an artifact, we can still be connected.

08:49.150 --> 08:50.080
I've opened up

08:50.080 --> 08:50.720
all my spiritual power to you.

08:51.200 --> 08:52.000
Try drawing it.

09:00.480 --> 09:01.130
It worked!

09:01.440 --> 09:02.720
I can draw power from you now.

09:03.390 --> 09:03.960
In that case,

09:04.320 --> 09:05.320
from now on, no matter where we go,

09:05.480 --> 09:06.750
stay by my side.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.440
You can use my power whenever you need it.

09:10.200 --> 09:11.000
As the saying goes,

09:11.150 --> 09:12.870
"If you borrow and return, borrowing again is easy."

09:13.270 --> 09:14.670
Since our spiritual powers are connected,

09:15.000 --> 09:15.690
I'll teach you

09:15.720 --> 09:17.200
the second part of the 'One wisp of qi to break the galaxy' technique.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.570
If one day

09:18.600 --> 09:19.790
I get a lot of power,

09:20.120 --> 09:20.840
you can also draw power

09:20.840 --> 09:22.080
from me in case of emergency.

09:23.720 --> 09:24.150
Alright.

09:24.750 --> 09:25.920
I'll let you be my master for a day.

09:28.590 --> 09:32.600
[Wang Suizhi's Residence]

09:47.550 --> 09:48.320
Su Yu,

09:48.750 --> 09:49.840
Xue Ranran,

09:50.720 --> 09:51.720
just you wait.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.790
I won't let you off easy.

09:59.340 --> 10:00.410
It seems since I took

10:00.440 --> 10:01.360
Su Yishui's antidote

10:01.380 --> 10:02.420
to neutralize the Resentment Liquid,

10:03.320 --> 10:04.870
my spiritual power has stopped growing.

10:06.070 --> 10:07.550
What did he do to me?

10:14.050 --> 10:15.370
You can't go on like this.

10:18.630 --> 10:19.120
What?

10:20.270 --> 10:21.600
Seeing me in such a miserable state,

10:21.910 --> 10:23.360
you don't even call me Master anymore.

10:24.670 --> 10:26.600
Or have you believed some rumors

10:27.360 --> 10:28.550
to be so disrespectful to me?

10:30.570 --> 10:31.550
I've made some lingzhi mushroom soup.

10:32.670 --> 10:33.630
Focus on your recovery first.

10:34.460 --> 10:35.430
This residence in the mountains

10:35.840 --> 10:36.670
is hidden and quiet,

10:37.320 --> 10:38.360
perfect for your recovery.

10:47.270 --> 10:48.120
What use

10:48.790 --> 10:49.480
is this lingzhi mushroom?

10:51.790 --> 10:52.870
Starting tomorrow,

10:53.630 --> 10:55.440
I want you to bring me ten of them every day.

10:56.150 --> 10:57.550
I want thousand-year-old lingzhi mushrooms.

10:59.140 --> 11:00.260
Thousand-year-old lingzhi mushrooms

11:00.840 --> 11:02.120
are reserved for the imperial family.

11:02.950 --> 11:04.670
How can ordinary people obtain them?

11:06.870 --> 11:07.600
Where's Lin Yeting?

11:08.360 --> 11:09.120
Ask him to get them.

11:10.150 --> 11:11.840
Those high-born disciples

11:12.150 --> 11:13.030
you recruited once

11:14.000 --> 11:15.480
openly cut ties with the sect

11:16.550 --> 11:18.320
the day you left the capital.

11:20.090 --> 11:21.180
Who's left then?

11:22.670 --> 11:24.030
Wester Sect's former disciples

11:24.720 --> 11:25.720
all followed us here.

11:26.670 --> 11:28.150
I haven't told them anything

11:29.630 --> 11:30.910
about what happened in the palace.

11:32.510 --> 11:34.200
You're in a difficult situation now.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.270
When things settle down,

11:38.790 --> 11:40.030
you can tell them yourself.

11:42.600 --> 11:43.200
Wu.

12:02.360 --> 12:03.480
My injuries are severe,

12:04.510 --> 12:05.720
and my power is constrained.

12:06.690 --> 12:07.840
Without more spiritual treasures,

12:07.870 --> 12:09.000
I won't be able to recover.

12:10.870 --> 12:11.960
I'll find a way.

12:13.000 --> 12:13.550
Thank you so much,

12:14.320 --> 12:14.870
Suizhi.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.550
The world ruined me and destroyed my reputation,

12:22.270 --> 12:23.080
but I, Mu Qingge,

12:23.240 --> 12:24.200
have a clear conscience.

12:24.750 --> 12:25.870
We'll find a way to help you, Master.

12:26.200 --> 12:26.840
We'll go right away.

12:27.030 --> 12:27.520
Let's go!

12:27.550 --> 12:27.910
Let's go!

12:34.790 --> 12:35.720
You promised me

12:36.300 --> 12:37.090
that you would personally

12:37.120 --> 12:37.960
reveal your identity to them.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.270
But why did you…

12:41.240 --> 12:42.440
When did I ever promise that?

12:44.080 --> 12:45.000
Su Yu…

12:46.200 --> 12:47.120
The Crown Princess…

12:48.510 --> 12:49.360
Madam Battle…

12:50.510 --> 12:52.390
I used to have

12:53.200 --> 12:54.720
the best of everything.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.480
But in the blink of an eye,

13:00.630 --> 13:01.840
it's all gone.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.390
There's no turning back for me.

13:05.870 --> 13:06.510
At worst,

13:07.150 --> 13:08.190
I'll die here

13:09.320 --> 13:10.720
to avoid endless

13:10.960 --> 13:12.840
humiliation and despair in the future.

13:16.630 --> 13:17.870
Why do you have to do this,

13:19.000 --> 13:19.720
Wu?

13:22.720 --> 13:23.270
Alright,

13:24.960 --> 13:26.200
I won't say anything.

13:43.480 --> 13:44.080
Why?

13:47.270 --> 13:48.190
Because you like me?

13:55.670 --> 13:57.240
Seeing me in such a miserable state,

13:57.850 --> 13:58.720
you think I should

13:57.910 --> 14:01.410
♫Who is that alone under the tree?♫

13:58.750 --> 13:59.840
be grateful for your affection

14:00.200 --> 14:00.880
and throw myself

14:00.910 --> 14:02.080
into your arms?

14:02.530 --> 14:07.680
♫Stained with a light and clear glow♫

14:03.440 --> 14:04.000
No.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.240
Do you remember that

14:08.090 --> 14:12.550
♫Repeatedly awakened from dreams by the shattered shadow of the moon♫

14:08.910 --> 14:10.080
25 years ago,

14:11.380 --> 14:13.090
you saved me at the foot of Mount Wester?

14:13.300 --> 14:18.800
♫Outside the mountain, longing reflected in the limpid eyes♫

14:15.000 --> 14:16.440
I was not a talented cultivator

14:16.960 --> 14:18.110
and was bullied by my senior brothers.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.790
You stood up for me.

14:20.620 --> 14:24.300
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

14:23.840 --> 14:25.270
I thought you were a disciple of Wester Sect,

14:24.920 --> 14:30.140
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

14:25.600 --> 14:26.670
so I joined Wester Sect.

14:27.720 --> 14:28.790
I was very grateful to you.

14:30.480 --> 14:31.670
Every time you came to Mount Wester,

14:30.630 --> 14:35.930
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

14:32.750 --> 14:33.720
I was so happy

14:34.790 --> 14:35.750
to see you.

14:36.190 --> 14:41.420
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

14:38.000 --> 14:39.080
I always hoped

14:41.440 --> 14:42.960
that you could live a happier life.

14:41.700 --> 14:47.500
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

14:44.630 --> 14:45.630
It's the same now.

14:47.520 --> 14:52.630
♫To face all the love and hatred, the rights and wrongs♫

14:47.790 --> 14:49.030
I hope you can stop

14:49.440 --> 14:51.150
and think about what you really want

14:51.270 --> 14:52.150
and where you should go.

14:52.920 --> 14:58.880
♫Our tortuous fate alternating endlessly between partings and reunions, joy and sorrow♫

14:58.910 --> 15:00.120
I need spiritual treasures.

14:58.980 --> 15:04.180
♫Only after experiencing death and rebirth do you realize its preciousness♫

15:01.630 --> 15:02.790
I need to advance in cultivation.

15:03.550 --> 15:05.030
I need to take back everything that was mine!

15:04.200 --> 15:09.940
♫A destiny full of twists and turns, a love fraught with hardship♫

15:06.200 --> 15:07.960
You have luck on your side.

15:08.550 --> 15:09.840
Wealth and power come to you effortlessly,

15:10.080 --> 15:15.250
♫But I remain fearless with no regrets♫

15:10.290 --> 15:11.720
yet you refuse to give me more

15:11.750 --> 15:13.200
and better spiritual treasures to help me!

15:14.030 --> 15:15.480
Instead, you're saying those sarcastic words

15:15.630 --> 15:16.390
to brush me off!

15:15.640 --> 15:21.450
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

15:18.440 --> 15:19.840
I just can spot

15:20.150 --> 15:21.320
financial opportunities

15:21.390 --> 15:22.240
before others do.

15:21.610 --> 15:26.700
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

15:22.840 --> 15:24.600
It's not like I can conjure wealth from thin air.

15:25.510 --> 15:26.600
Master always taught me

15:26.770 --> 15:32.580
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

15:27.160 --> 15:28.360
to be upright and honest

15:28.510 --> 15:29.910
and to have solid abilities

15:30.200 --> 15:31.910
before grasping at opportunities.

15:32.600 --> 15:37.710
♫To face all the love and hatred, the rights and wrongs♫

15:32.720 --> 15:34.390
It's the same with almost everything.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.120
Master, Master, Master!

15:36.150 --> 15:37.550
Your master is always right!

15:38.000 --> 15:43.960
♫Our tortuous fate alternating endlessly between partings and reunions, joy and sorrow♫

15:40.440 --> 15:41.790
She's always been lucky

15:43.120 --> 15:44.720
and always gets whatever she wants

15:44.060 --> 15:49.260
♫Only after experiencing death and rebirth do you realize its preciousness♫

15:45.360 --> 15:46.910
without even trying.

15:48.120 --> 15:48.720
And me?

15:49.280 --> 15:55.020
♫A destiny full of twists and turns, a love fraught with hardship♫

15:50.000 --> 15:51.600
I've never had much to begin with.

15:52.500 --> 15:53.890
And wanting more is a crime?

15:55.160 --> 16:00.330
♫But I remain fearless with no regrets♫

15:59.630 --> 16:01.030
You say you like me.

16:00.720 --> 16:06.530
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

16:06.030 --> 16:07.000
But I think

16:06.690 --> 16:13.160
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

16:08.150 --> 16:09.720
you just enjoy watching me suffer.

16:25.390 --> 16:28.000
Colluding with enemies, manipulating devils,

16:28.200 --> 16:29.440
and plotting against the Crown Prince.

16:30.010 --> 16:30.720
These vicious people

16:30.750 --> 16:31.270
should be put in prison!

16:31.270 --> 16:32.390
Exactly.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.000
You wouldn't

16:34.150 --> 16:35.360
be able to tell just by their looks.

16:35.670 --> 16:36.450
They should be arrested.

16:37.630 --> 16:37.960
They…

16:39.270 --> 16:40.030
These people…

16:40.550 --> 16:40.940
Criminals.

16:41.080 --> 16:41.360
They…

16:41.440 --> 16:41.910
Criminals!

16:42.120 --> 16:42.630
Arrest them!

16:43.440 --> 16:43.860
Watch out!

16:46.870 --> 16:47.390
They're over there!

16:47.790 --> 16:48.240
After them!

16:49.710 --> 16:51.480
The Crown Prince actually stooped so low as to slander us

16:51.600 --> 16:52.600
and tarnish Wester Sect's reputation.

16:53.120 --> 16:53.550
That's not all.

16:54.240 --> 16:54.870
I bet he's also spread the word

16:54.870 --> 16:55.960
about Master being the Demon's child

16:56.150 --> 16:57.320
to all major Heavenly Sects

16:57.630 --> 16:58.390
in order to use them

16:58.390 --> 16:59.080
to deal with us.

17:00.690 --> 17:01.950
If the Heavenly Ones get involved,

17:02.320 --> 17:03.480
I'm afraid we'll be outnumbered.

17:04.000 --> 17:04.680
We need to be careful

17:05.000 --> 17:05.640
on this journey.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.310
There are checkpoints all along the way.

17:07.640 --> 17:08.310
We have to use forbidden techniques

17:08.310 --> 17:09.030
to disguise ourselves,

17:09.410 --> 17:10.329
but that won't fool the Heavenly Ones.

17:11.000 --> 17:11.750
We must not miss the chance

17:11.750 --> 17:12.440
to seal the Spirit Spring.

17:12.650 --> 17:13.440
If we encounter any Heavenly Ones,

17:13.680 --> 17:14.200
avoid them if possible.

17:14.410 --> 17:15.170
The less trouble, the better.

17:15.960 --> 17:16.310
Yes.

17:16.720 --> 17:17.400
Yes.

17:18.440 --> 17:18.920
Not enough!

17:19.640 --> 17:20.599
I want something better.

17:21.630 --> 17:22.280
But this is already

17:22.310 --> 17:23.310
the finest spiritual medicine.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.589
Then the problem must be the alchemy furnace.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.040
Go find me

17:27.069 --> 17:28.200
a better alchemy furnace.

17:31.310 --> 17:32.070
I put you on the spot?

17:34.550 --> 17:35.830
Then you can leave.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.240
I never forced you to stay.

17:39.840 --> 17:41.210
I know you still need time

17:41.240 --> 17:42.000
to come around.

17:43.350 --> 17:44.030
I can wait.

17:46.200 --> 17:46.680
Don't worry.

17:47.920 --> 17:48.880
I won't leave you.

17:59.300 --> 18:00.990
There's always a way out.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.310
You got here so fast.

18:05.790 --> 18:06.310
So,

18:07.070 --> 18:08.110
has Su Yu made up his mind

18:08.110 --> 18:09.510
to hunt me down and kill me?

18:10.720 --> 18:11.510
You misunderstand.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.750
I'm not here to harm you.

18:14.440 --> 18:15.680
Instead, on behalf of the Crown Prince,

18:16.070 --> 18:17.070
I've come to seek cooperation.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.350
Cooperation?

18:19.440 --> 18:20.200
Impossible.

18:20.850 --> 18:22.330
He ordered my death.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.110
I heard it myself.

18:26.130 --> 18:28.540
His Highness is now in grave danger.

18:29.020 --> 18:30.450
He urgently needs someone powerful

18:30.480 --> 18:31.240
to extend his life.

18:31.920 --> 18:32.550
Immortal Master,

18:33.350 --> 18:34.400
if you're willing to help,

18:34.950 --> 18:36.150
you can still be

18:36.790 --> 18:37.880
Madam Battle.

18:38.600 --> 18:39.840
All the wealth and power you once had

18:40.310 --> 18:43.000
will be given back to you.

18:43.510 --> 18:44.440
Besides,

18:45.030 --> 18:45.960
that powerful person

18:46.400 --> 18:47.350
can help you

18:47.750 --> 18:49.720
obtain unparalleled spiritual power.

18:51.640 --> 18:52.550
Everything you desire

18:53.270 --> 18:54.240
will be yours again.

18:55.000 --> 18:56.510
Then who is this powerful person he's looking for?

19:02.030 --> 19:02.640
Him?

19:04.610 --> 19:06.370
But he's been missing for so long.

19:07.160 --> 19:08.590
How do you know his whereabouts?

19:10.160 --> 19:12.720
He suddenly disappeared back then

19:13.480 --> 19:15.030
because Mu Qingge

19:15.080 --> 19:16.430
sealed him in the netherworld.

19:17.400 --> 19:19.750
Su Yishui is heading there now.

19:20.160 --> 19:22.640
You just need to sneak into the netherworld during the chaos.

19:23.000 --> 19:23.960
Then you'll find him.

19:26.480 --> 19:27.720
With his help,

19:29.000 --> 19:30.640
I'll surely regain my spiritual power

19:31.240 --> 19:32.430
and trample her underfoot.

19:36.920 --> 19:38.590
But with my current power,

19:39.680 --> 19:41.160
how can I sneak into the netherworld

19:41.310 --> 19:42.160
without Su Yishui noticing?

19:42.960 --> 19:43.680
Don't worry,

19:44.240 --> 19:44.920
His Highness has already

19:44.920 --> 19:46.790
revealed Su Yishui's identity as the Demon's child

19:46.920 --> 19:48.240
to all Heavenly Sects.

19:49.160 --> 19:51.350
You just need to add fuel to the fire,

19:52.270 --> 19:53.400
and those Heavenly Ones

19:53.960 --> 19:55.270
will handle the rest for you.

19:58.520 --> 19:59.520
When I arrived at the East Sea

19:59.550 --> 20:00.590
with my disciples,

20:01.160 --> 20:01.840
Su Yishui

20:01.950 --> 20:03.300
had already fled.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.310
He didn't return to Mount Wester either.

20:05.550 --> 20:06.270
Where on earth

20:06.790 --> 20:08.310
has he fled to?

20:08.790 --> 20:10.270
I know where he is!

20:17.590 --> 20:18.200
Mu Qingge,

20:18.830 --> 20:20.680
why did you pretend to be the Demon's child back then?

20:21.000 --> 20:21.970
We were all

20:22.000 --> 20:23.030
fooled by you.

20:24.820 --> 20:26.110
Immortal Masters, please calm down.

20:26.580 --> 20:27.470
Back then, Su Yishui

20:27.790 --> 20:28.830
threatened me with my younger sister

20:28.830 --> 20:29.510
Wu's life,

20:29.750 --> 20:31.480
forcing me to publicly admit that I was the Demon's child.

20:31.990 --> 20:33.400
That way, he could secretly control the Spirit Spring

20:33.670 --> 20:34.550
and seize power over the universe.

20:34.960 --> 20:36.160
But for some unknown reason,

20:36.350 --> 20:37.680
the Spirit Spring wasn't under his control.

20:38.070 --> 20:39.110
To cover his tracks,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.480
he revived me

20:40.830 --> 20:41.960
to divert everyone's attention.

20:42.680 --> 20:43.880
It was only after I was reborn

20:43.920 --> 20:44.830
that I realized he had deceived me.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.400
Wu had been killed by him.

20:47.510 --> 20:49.310
Afterward, he forced me to make a soul oath.

20:49.920 --> 20:50.880
If I say the truth

20:51.200 --> 20:52.200
that Su Yishui is…

20:57.350 --> 20:58.680
It's indeed a soul oath.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.790
Right now, he's taking the Spirit Spring

21:02.240 --> 21:02.960
to the netherworld.

21:04.290 --> 21:05.210
Immortal Masters,

21:05.310 --> 21:06.270
please stop him.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.960
Don't let him wreak more havoc.

21:10.590 --> 21:11.510
Immortal Masters, please stay calm.

21:12.160 --> 21:13.120
Even if she made a soul oath,

21:13.410 --> 21:14.000
it doesn't mean

21:14.030 --> 21:15.110
everything she says is true.

21:15.900 --> 21:17.320
Nor does it erase

21:17.350 --> 21:18.070
all her past crimes.

21:18.830 --> 21:21.310
I know I've wronged Immortal Kaiyuan

21:21.510 --> 21:23.070
and those who perished at Heavenly Meridian Mountain,

21:23.830 --> 21:25.120
but he forced me to do those things!

21:30.200 --> 21:30.960
The Resentment Liquid in me

21:31.240 --> 21:32.200
was his doing.

21:33.270 --> 21:34.830
I only said what I did at Heavenly Meridian Mountain

21:35.070 --> 21:35.880
because I had no choice.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.680
Now that I've finally rid myself of Resentment Liquid,

21:39.110 --> 21:40.310
I refuse to aid his evil any longer.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.000
I won't be a pawn in his schemes

21:42.000 --> 21:43.270
to wreak havoc on the world.

21:47.400 --> 21:48.680
Someone so vicious

21:49.110 --> 21:50.790
is unforgivable!

21:51.350 --> 21:52.510
Where is the Demon's child now?

21:53.050 --> 21:54.360
He's heading to Fanyao

21:54.480 --> 21:55.640
with his disciples.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.000
Eternals, attention!

21:59.240 --> 21:59.830
I haven't

22:00.510 --> 22:01.590
fully recovered yet.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.440
Liangyu,

22:03.750 --> 22:05.720
you will take charge.

22:06.110 --> 22:07.750
Gather all Eternals and set out

22:08.200 --> 22:10.000
to capture the Demon's child, Su Yishui!

22:11.200 --> 22:11.550
Yes.

22:12.110 --> 22:13.310
Follow me to capture the Demon's child

22:13.680 --> 22:14.720
and take the Spirit Spring.

22:15.510 --> 22:16.110
Yes!

22:17.440 --> 22:18.750
Scuds, come with me.

22:19.030 --> 22:20.510
We'll hunt the Demon's child down!

22:20.880 --> 22:21.480
Yes!

22:22.270 --> 22:23.110
We Hollows

22:23.310 --> 22:24.310
will join this fight too.

22:38.880 --> 22:41.830
[The battlefield at Fanyao]

22:43.110 --> 22:43.720
Along the way,

22:43.750 --> 22:45.200
we ran into quite a few Heavenly Ones.

22:45.830 --> 22:46.880
It seems the Heavenly Sects are really

22:47.000 --> 22:47.720
taking action against us.

22:50.110 --> 22:50.830
It looks like

22:51.550 --> 22:52.160
a great battle

22:52.160 --> 22:53.440
took place here before.

22:54.590 --> 22:55.960
A lot of malicious energy

22:55.980 --> 22:56.750
is gathering in the air.

23:02.840 --> 23:03.930
The Spirit Spring seems to have

23:03.960 --> 23:04.750
a special reaction to this place.

23:05.030 --> 23:06.680
It looks like the entrance to the netherworld

23:07.030 --> 23:07.830
is right here.

23:11.790 --> 23:13.110
I've put a talisman here.

23:13.640 --> 23:14.400
When the Blood Moon appears,

23:14.590 --> 23:15.750
the Yin Eye Stone will react.

23:17.880 --> 23:18.880
For the next few hours,

23:19.350 --> 23:20.370
you go to the nearby town

23:20.400 --> 23:21.000
and get something to eat.

23:23.000 --> 23:23.880
But at a time like this,

23:24.240 --> 23:25.310
I can't eat anything.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.070
Relax.

23:27.350 --> 23:28.620
The greater the danger ahead,

23:28.790 --> 23:30.550
the more we should eat, drink, and enjoy ourselves.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.910
We need to keep our energy up

23:32.000 --> 23:33.400
to win the fight later.

23:33.750 --> 23:34.620
Stay low-key in life,

23:34.680 --> 23:35.790
but eat like a king, right?

23:36.960 --> 23:37.830
You're right, Ranran.

23:39.880 --> 23:41.110
The Heavenly Ones are still looking for us.

23:42.070 --> 23:43.070
To avoid drawing attention,

23:43.400 --> 23:44.720
we should split up for now.

23:45.960 --> 23:47.270
When the Blood Moon appears,

23:48.000 --> 23:49.000
we'll regroup here.

23:51.440 --> 23:56.300
[Wuma Town]

24:02.400 --> 24:04.030
It's my first time in Wuma Town,

24:04.310 --> 24:05.790
but it somehow feels familiar.

24:06.000 --> 24:07.200
That's because you came here in your past life.

24:07.940 --> 24:08.760
No wonder.

24:15.550 --> 24:17.270
Chen's Pan-fried Bun Shop from the Collection of Entertainment.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.440
They have a shop here too.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.960
You only read about them in the Collection of Entertainment before.

24:21.270 --> 24:22.350
You finally get to try them now.

24:23.240 --> 24:23.920
Let's go try them.

24:24.030 --> 24:24.480
Sure.

24:36.960 --> 24:37.440
Master,

24:38.000 --> 24:39.440
you don't seem nervous at all.

24:41.550 --> 24:42.240
After everything

24:42.270 --> 24:42.830
we've been through,

24:43.400 --> 24:43.920
I believe

24:44.270 --> 24:45.400
we can make it through this time too.

24:45.880 --> 24:46.960
Besides, didn't you say

24:47.240 --> 24:48.720
we should eat and enjoy ourselves even more before a big fight?

24:49.270 --> 24:49.830
This place is lively.

24:50.240 --> 24:51.350
I'll take you around later.

24:51.750 --> 24:52.160
Okay.

25:03.830 --> 25:05.440
Try the dipping sauce in the Collection of Entertainment.

25:14.200 --> 25:14.680
How is it?

25:18.070 --> 25:19.670
After we return the Spirit Spring to the netherworld,

25:19.920 --> 25:21.400
let's travel across the world together

25:21.680 --> 25:22.400
and try everything delicious.

25:22.750 --> 25:23.160
Alright.

25:25.070 --> 25:25.510
Eat up.

25:31.750 --> 25:33.160
Master, skewers!

25:33.750 --> 25:35.160
Freshly grilled lamb skewers.

25:35.590 --> 25:37.000
Sir, how many would you like?

25:37.830 --> 25:38.270
Here,

25:38.440 --> 25:38.880
I'll take five.

25:39.030 --> 25:39.510
Alright!

25:42.200 --> 25:42.830
Here you go.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.550
Thank you.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.200
You're welcome.

25:44.830 --> 25:45.510
Take care.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.510
They smell so good!

25:48.240 --> 25:49.960
Lamb skewers! Beef skewers!

25:51.200 --> 25:52.640
Great, great!

25:55.110 --> 25:56.510
Great, great!

25:59.010 --> 26:00.170
Congratulations to this young lady

26:00.200 --> 26:02.350
for winning the top prize!

26:02.690 --> 26:03.400
Great!

26:03.440 --> 26:04.070
Amazing!

26:04.200 --> 26:05.200
It's the top prize.

26:06.110 --> 26:06.750
She's amazing.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.680
This is the top prize?

26:09.680 --> 26:10.110
Miss,

26:10.400 --> 26:12.000
don't underestimate this mirror.

26:12.310 --> 26:13.920
It's called the Mirror of Fated Love.

26:14.710 --> 26:15.850
It's said that

26:15.880 --> 26:17.270
a Mirror Immortal resides within.

26:17.750 --> 26:20.110
If you sincerely knock on the mirror three times,

26:20.400 --> 26:22.310
you'll see the love of your past life.

26:24.600 --> 26:25.450
That sounds amazing.

26:25.750 --> 26:26.480
Are you serious?

26:26.830 --> 26:27.440
Miss, look.

26:27.960 --> 26:29.060
Honesty is our principle;

26:29.240 --> 26:30.440
no deception for the young or old!

26:30.910 --> 26:31.800
Come on, next one!

26:31.830 --> 26:32.550
Next, next!

26:32.920 --> 26:33.510
Come on, come on!

26:34.070 --> 26:34.640
Come on!

26:42.350 --> 26:42.880
Master,

26:42.960 --> 26:44.440
have I been tricked?

26:44.880 --> 26:46.160
This mirror doesn't work at all.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.480
How could it not work?

26:48.830 --> 26:50.000
Close your eyes and try again.

26:55.830 --> 26:56.430
Open your eyes now.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.200
Look.

27:02.680 --> 27:03.720
The love of your previous life and this life

27:03.960 --> 27:04.640
is right here.

27:24.440 --> 27:24.920
Take care.

27:24.920 --> 27:26.160
This pattern is really beautiful.

27:26.400 --> 27:26.790
Look!

27:27.270 --> 27:28.030
The one you picked

27:28.070 --> 27:28.640
is really nice.

27:29.480 --> 27:30.200
Yes, look.

27:30.750 --> 27:31.400
Sir,

27:32.150 --> 27:33.000
why are these lanterns

27:33.030 --> 27:33.960
selling so well?

27:34.590 --> 27:35.680
Miss, you might not know,

27:35.970 --> 27:36.890
in a few days, it will be

27:36.920 --> 27:37.480
the local Lantern Festival.

27:37.720 --> 27:38.170
At the festival,

27:38.200 --> 27:39.690
single men and women will exchange lanterns

27:39.720 --> 27:40.440
to express their feelings.

27:40.800 --> 27:42.040
So everyone is rushing to buy

27:42.070 --> 27:43.550
their favorite lantern in advance.

27:43.920 --> 27:44.790
Sir, sir.

27:45.640 --> 27:46.270
Lantern Festival?

27:50.590 --> 27:51.510
I heard that in a few days,

27:52.000 --> 27:53.160
in Wuma Town near the border,

27:53.310 --> 27:54.110
there will be a Lantern Festival.

27:56.400 --> 27:57.030
Master,

27:57.480 --> 27:58.960
these lanterns are so beautiful!

28:00.270 --> 28:01.070
These lanterns are beautiful?

28:01.650 --> 28:02.690
Does that mean

28:02.720 --> 28:03.350
the one I made isn't?

28:04.760 --> 28:06.200
The one you made...

28:13.550 --> 28:14.590
Someone

28:15.200 --> 28:16.480
was jealous of herself

28:16.700 --> 28:17.950
and dragged innocent people into it.

28:18.830 --> 28:20.160
I acted on impulse, okay?

28:22.000 --> 28:22.550
How about

28:23.200 --> 28:24.550
I make one to make it up to you?

28:24.960 --> 28:25.510
What do you think?

28:27.590 --> 28:28.030
For real?

28:30.790 --> 28:31.740
I've done my research.

28:31.800 --> 28:32.800
The mountain bamboo here

28:32.830 --> 28:34.160
is perfect for making lanterns.

28:34.830 --> 28:35.240
Master,

28:35.510 --> 28:36.310
lend me some spiritual power.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.670
There's a power fluctuation over there.

28:47.260 --> 28:48.670
It's my primal power.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.640
Did I hide something

28:50.830 --> 28:51.960
in that cave?

28:54.510 --> 28:55.480
Let's go take a look.

29:12.720 --> 29:13.750
The Eternal Flame…

29:18.050 --> 29:19.480
I actually used the precious Eternal Flame

29:19.510 --> 29:20.590
to light these lanterns.

29:22.130 --> 29:23.480
Let's go to the Lantern Festival together.

29:24.070 --> 29:24.790
By then,

29:25.510 --> 29:26.720
I'll show you something amazing.

29:32.400 --> 29:33.350
Are these lanterns…

30:01.440 --> 30:03.030
I just remembered something.

30:03.680 --> 30:04.480
It seems

30:04.980 --> 30:06.330
you used to love lanterns.

30:07.130 --> 30:08.210
So I made these for you

30:08.240 --> 30:08.960
as a gift.

30:10.200 --> 30:11.200
But I can't recall

30:11.440 --> 30:12.790
why you liked lanterns.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.920
I lived in poverty when I was young.

30:16.880 --> 30:17.720
Every festival,

30:18.590 --> 30:19.750
I'd watch other children

30:19.920 --> 30:21.350
walking through the streets with lanterns

30:21.880 --> 30:22.680
and envy them.

30:24.440 --> 30:25.310
Every time that happened,

30:25.720 --> 30:26.550
I'd comfort myself by thinking

30:27.750 --> 30:29.110
next year I'd surely have money to buy one.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.000
Later, my father took me back,

30:32.550 --> 30:34.160
and I never thought of that wish again.

30:36.590 --> 30:37.680
Until one day,

30:40.200 --> 30:41.680
someone lit up all the lanterns for me,

30:42.400 --> 30:43.830
illuminating my way back home.

30:51.200 --> 30:51.960
But I never

30:51.960 --> 30:53.200
told anyone about this.

30:53.920 --> 30:54.720
I don't know how you

30:54.750 --> 30:55.680
noticed that back then.

30:56.790 --> 30:57.920
Although the memories are gone,

30:58.510 --> 31:00.960
some feelings still remain.

31:01.720 --> 31:02.960
When you care about someone,

31:03.590 --> 31:04.750
you don't need words—

31:05.110 --> 31:06.790
you just know how they feel.

31:08.040 --> 31:09.200
So back then, you…

31:11.210 --> 31:16.140
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

31:17.980 --> 31:23.270
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

31:18.350 --> 31:19.440
Consecrating the sword with vital blood

31:19.750 --> 31:20.720
reduces your lifespan.

31:20.830 --> 31:21.110
Is…

31:21.400 --> 31:22.310
is it worth it?

31:22.680 --> 31:24.160
Is Mu Qingge that important to you?

31:24.650 --> 31:27.670
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

31:26.160 --> 31:26.920
Do you have a death wish?

31:27.310 --> 31:28.920
You hurt her, so I'll take your life!

31:28.110 --> 31:30.670
♫Solitary branches hidden in clothing♫

31:31.400 --> 31:32.640
Reckless boy,

31:31.490 --> 31:37.920
♫Extend fate to call you back; How lucky to meet by chance♫

31:34.270 --> 31:35.720
don't risk your life so carelessly again.

31:38.500 --> 31:43.840
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

31:45.380 --> 31:50.730
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

31:47.420 --> 31:48.560
You just missed

31:48.590 --> 31:49.790
the only chance to kill me

31:49.890 --> 31:50.890
and gain your freedom.

31:51.910 --> 31:55.070
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

31:52.000 --> 31:53.200
Don't you regret it?

31:55.350 --> 31:58.470
♫Demon or immortal?♫

31:55.720 --> 31:57.350
I, Su Yishui, never take advantage of others' weaknesses.

31:58.070 --> 31:58.640
Moreover,

31:58.870 --> 32:04.530
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

31:59.070 --> 32:00.240
I'll defeat you fair and square

32:00.790 --> 32:01.790
and sever our master-disciple bond.

32:02.830 --> 32:03.400
Alright,

32:04.240 --> 32:05.550
I'll be waiting for that day.

32:05.730 --> 32:09.000
♫If love wants me to die♫

32:09.540 --> 32:12.600
♫I won't give up because of you♫

32:10.310 --> 32:11.110
But until then,

32:12.110 --> 32:12.960
take good care of yourself.

32:12.630 --> 32:14.540
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

32:14.200 --> 32:15.160
If you want to slack off,

32:14.560 --> 32:18.580
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

32:15.480 --> 32:16.480
just tell me what needs to be done,

32:17.240 --> 32:17.790
and I'll handle it for you.

32:18.610 --> 32:22.680
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

32:19.880 --> 32:20.400
What do you think?

32:23.180 --> 32:26.150
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

32:26.650 --> 32:32.770
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

32:32.940 --> 32:36.770
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

32:33.590 --> 32:34.000
Okay.

32:36.900 --> 32:39.810
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

32:40.140 --> 32:46.820
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

32:49.450 --> 32:50.360
I heard that in a few days,

32:50.550 --> 32:51.680
in Wuma Town near the border,

32:51.720 --> 32:52.440
there will be a Lantern Festival.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.030
Let's go together.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.400
By then,

32:56.110 --> 32:57.310
I'll show you something amazing.

33:02.030 --> 33:02.620
At this moment,

33:03.480 --> 33:04.480
I can remember

33:05.350 --> 33:06.070
the feeling

33:06.070 --> 33:07.590
behind every lantern I made here.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.200
You once said

33:12.030 --> 33:13.310
you didn't know if my actions in my past life

33:14.200 --> 33:15.280
were for love

33:14.650 --> 33:19.990
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

33:15.440 --> 33:16.200
or for righteousness.

33:17.590 --> 33:18.400
In Wuma Town,

33:19.110 --> 33:19.830
there's a tradition of gifting lanterns

33:19.880 --> 33:21.240
to express one's feelings.

33:21.520 --> 33:26.880
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

33:23.070 --> 33:24.240
This cave full of lanterns

33:25.350 --> 33:26.200
is my answer.

33:28.000 --> 33:28.550
I think

33:28.060 --> 33:31.220
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

33:29.920 --> 33:30.830
the past me

33:31.490 --> 33:34.610
♫Demon or immortal?♫

33:31.750 --> 33:33.030
must have had feelings for you too.

33:35.020 --> 33:40.670
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

33:41.880 --> 33:45.140
♫If love wants me to die♫

33:45.690 --> 33:48.750
♫I won't give up because of you♫

33:48.770 --> 33:50.680
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

33:49.550 --> 33:50.350
Ranran.

33:50.710 --> 33:54.730
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

33:51.320 --> 33:53.030
I used to complain about the unfairness of fate,

33:53.750 --> 33:55.270
but in fact, what I longed for all my life

33:54.750 --> 33:58.830
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

33:56.750 --> 33:57.880
was already by my side.

33:59.320 --> 34:02.290
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

34:02.630 --> 34:08.750
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

34:22.880 --> 34:26.139
♫If love wants me to die♫

34:26.690 --> 34:29.750
♫I won't give up because of you♫

34:29.770 --> 34:31.679
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

34:31.710 --> 34:35.730
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

34:36.510 --> 34:40.340
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

34:40.389 --> 34:43.300
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

34:43.710 --> 34:49.900
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

34:50.310 --> 34:58.980
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

34:59.070 --> 35:00.190
The Yin Eye Stone is reacting.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.760
The netherworld has appeared.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.670
Notify the others.

35:46.880 --> 35:47.510
The Blood Moon.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.880
Once it fully emerges,

35:50.510 --> 35:51.920
the entrance to the netherworld will appear.

35:54.320 --> 35:54.840
Demon's child!

35:56.110 --> 35:57.000
Hand over the Spirit Spring!

36:08.960 --> 36:09.800
Su Yishui,

36:10.400 --> 36:11.630
you framed your own Master,

36:11.630 --> 36:12.550
deceived everyone,

36:13.000 --> 36:14.440
and want to do more evil

36:14.840 --> 36:16.110
by becoming a devil with the Spirit Spring.

36:16.590 --> 36:17.590
We Heavenly Ones

36:17.920 --> 36:19.320
won't allow you to bring disaster upon the world!

36:19.710 --> 36:21.060
I advise you to repent now

36:21.400 --> 36:22.440
so you might get a lighter punishment!

36:24.190 --> 36:24.670
Shui,

36:25.030 --> 36:26.430
it's not too late to stop now.

36:26.760 --> 36:28.080
Don't repeat the same mistake

36:28.280 --> 36:29.280
and cause more bloodshed.

36:33.280 --> 36:34.440
Although my master is the Demon's child,

36:35.030 --> 36:36.670
he doesn't intend to use the Spirit Spring for evil.

36:37.110 --> 36:37.710
We came here

36:37.710 --> 36:39.070
to seal the Spirit Spring,

36:39.480 --> 36:40.920
not to use it to make a devil.

36:41.510 --> 36:42.070
That's right.

36:42.550 --> 36:43.110
Foolish!

36:43.410 --> 36:45.250
The Demon's child is full of lies!

36:46.330 --> 36:47.640
Since you've chosen to side

36:47.670 --> 36:48.590
with the Demon's child

36:48.710 --> 36:49.630
and aid his wicked cause,

36:50.320 --> 36:52.000
don't blame us for showing no mercy!

37:07.840 --> 37:08.550
We only have 15 minutes.

37:08.760 --> 37:09.590
We need to hurry.

37:22.070 --> 37:23.110
The entrance to the netherworld.

37:34.600 --> 37:36.090
The Demon's child is about to open the netherworld.

37:36.190 --> 37:37.150
Stop him!

38:34.960 --> 38:35.510
Xi'er!

38:35.710 --> 38:36.410
What's wrong with you?

38:43.580 --> 38:44.430
Be careful of the demonic energy!

38:44.630 --> 38:45.590
Hold your breath and stay focused!

39:18.000 --> 39:18.510
I just…

39:18.840 --> 39:19.800
lost my sanity.

39:20.070 --> 39:21.560
My mind was filled with hatred and killing intent.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.400
It must be because of the demonic energy.

39:24.510 --> 39:25.230
What do we do?

39:29.070 --> 39:30.590
The Blood Moon's demonic energy

39:30.590 --> 39:31.400
can make people lose their sanity.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.070
Take the Sanity Pills.

39:33.480 --> 39:34.580
They can dispel inner devils

39:34.710 --> 39:35.590
and bring sanity back.

39:36.230 --> 39:37.360
You're with the Demon's child.

39:37.960 --> 39:39.190
Who knows what your true intentions are?

39:40.760 --> 39:41.460
I trust her.

39:50.030 --> 39:51.360
Su Yishui, hand over the Spirit Spring!

39:51.630 --> 39:52.760
Not a chance, you demon!

39:56.910 --> 39:57.590
Ranran!

40:04.110 --> 40:04.820
Master!

40:20.880 --> 40:21.550
My Lord!

40:23.220 --> 40:23.940
Hongshan!

40:28.050 --> 40:28.640
Master!

40:28.670 --> 40:29.280
Guardian!

40:39.440 --> 40:40.170
Vermilion Bird!

40:57.550 --> 40:58.970
Seniors,

40:59.000 --> 40:59.810
please take care of everyone.

41:00.070 --> 41:01.520
After Master and I seal the Spirit Spring,

41:01.590 --> 41:02.320
we'll return immediately.

41:14.870 --> 41:15.280
This…

41:16.280 --> 41:16.670
This...

41:17.670 --> 41:19.760
Is everything you said true?

41:20.360 --> 41:22.150
Is Su Yishui really going to seal the Spirit Spring?

41:23.350 --> 41:24.580
If Master wanted to become a devil,

41:24.710 --> 41:25.800
why would he have bothered to save you all?

41:31.630 --> 41:32.110
Wait.

41:33.190 --> 41:34.030
Where's Mu Ranwu?

42:11.360 --> 42:12.030
Are you alright?

42:13.230 --> 42:14.320
Heaven and earth are inverted in the netherworld.

42:14.510 --> 42:16.030
You'll need time to adjust to using talismans here.

42:20.150 --> 42:20.630
So,

42:21.400 --> 42:22.230
this is the netherworld?

42:23.190 --> 42:24.510
The entrance has closed.

42:24.840 --> 42:25.550
How do we get out?

42:26.040 --> 42:27.070
Every time the netherworld opens an entrance,

42:27.190 --> 42:28.320
an exit is created.

42:28.710 --> 42:30.190
But it's a one-way exit

42:30.600 --> 42:31.890
and only exists for six hours.

42:32.520 --> 42:33.450
The tricky part is that

42:33.710 --> 42:34.880
its location in the mortal world is unpredictable.

42:35.150 --> 42:36.000
So this time...

42:37.030 --> 42:38.000
We got lucky.

42:38.550 --> 42:40.190
The exit is in the mountains near Wuma Town.

42:41.120 --> 42:41.480
Look.

42:42.030 --> 42:42.920
It's on top of that peak.

42:43.510 --> 42:44.570
We have six hours

42:44.680 --> 42:45.410
to find the ancient sealing formation

42:45.440 --> 42:46.070
for the Spirit Spring.

42:46.590 --> 42:47.440
Then we can leave.

42:51.920 --> 42:52.710
Where are the others?

42:53.230 --> 42:53.710
Watch out!

42:57.480 --> 42:58.150
Su Yishui,

42:58.590 --> 42:59.630
you're quite clever.

43:00.590 --> 43:01.440
Xue Ranran,

43:02.000 --> 43:02.880
no wonder I found you

43:03.000 --> 43:04.070
interesting from the start.

43:04.510 --> 43:05.840
So you're the real Mu Qingge.

43:06.710 --> 43:07.510
No need to rush.

43:07.710 --> 43:09.190
I'll take down Su Yishui first.

43:09.280 --> 43:10.280
Then we can settle the score

43:10.280 --> 43:11.400
from our past life.
